The two projects here are files of the borrowed suites that are kept as several translation units:

- chibicc-function/ is test/function.c of chibicc (with test/common as its second unit), by Rui Ueyama, under the MIT
  licence. Where it comes from, what was changed and the licence text: ../chibicc/NOTICE and ../chibicc/LICENSE.
- scc-0193-incomplete/ is tests/cc/execute/0193-incomplete.c of scc with tests/cc/execute/test.c, the unit it is linked
  with upstream, by Roberto E. Vargas Caballero and the scc contributors, under the ISC licence. Where it comes from, what was
  changed and the licence text: ../scc/NOTICE and ../scc/LICENSE.
